  "item_short_desc": "<p>As a part of Rothco&rsquo;s Frontline Series, the Scout All Terrain Hybrid Tactical Boot is engineered to keep you on your feet and moving while offering unbeatable comfort and durability in any environment. The 6 inch height and padded collar provides ankle support and protection while allowing flexibility during quick and rapid movements. Just like our other Frontline boots, the Scout is TAA compliant. Developed with Rothco&rsquo;s Lock System, the Scout features a waterproof design that provides long-lasting comfort and enhanced traction.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": null,
  "description": "<p>As a part of Rothco&rsquo;s Frontline Series, the Scout All Terrain Hybrid Tactical Boot is engineered to keep you on your feet and moving while offering unbeatable comfort and durability in any environment. The 6 inch height and padded collar provides ankle support and protection while allowing flexibility during quick and rapid movements. Just like our other Frontline boots, the Scout is TAA compliant. Developed with Rothco&rsquo;s Lock System, the Scout features a waterproof design that provides long-lasting comfort and enhanced traction. H2O Lock Weather Protection System: Featuring a premium waterproof leather and polyester upper, these tactical hiking boots ensure your feet stay dry, no matter the environment. The low-profile boot utilizes a waterproof internal lining for added protection, with a moisture wicking mesh liner underneath for breathability while keeping water out. The gusseted tongue helps shield your foot from dirt and debris. Comfort Lock Fatigue Defense System: The molded EVA footbed and EVA midsole help absorb shock, cushioning your feet from impact while providing all-day comfort. These breathable all terrain tactical boots feature a lightweight flexible bonded construction and a nylon shank for added support and stability. Ground Lock Terrain Endurance System: These rugged boots come equipped with a non-slip and oil-resistant outsole with multidirectional grip lugs, allowing you to maintain your footing with enhanced grip and traction. The high abrasion rubber toe cap &amp; heel counter provide an additional layer of protection, including when taking off the boot by pushing down on the ankle. The non-marking outsole prevents leaving scuff marks on flooring. Ready at a Moment&rsquo;s Notice: From field operations to outdoor excursions, these ruggedly durable boots are great for hikers, hunters, military personnel, tactical enthusiasts, everyday wear, and more. On The Frontlines: Utilizing the Lock System, each boot within Rothco&rsquo;s Frontline Footwear Series is designed to tackle any job, all day, every day.</p>",
